{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"f958646ce56c4b238ed2c12c44960245","title":"Obtaining a Signing Certificate Fingerprint on the Wearable Device","lang":"en","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"Wear Engine","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V15","anchorList":[],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000001920110213\"></a><a name=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000001920110213\"></a>  <h1>Obtaining a Signing Certificate Fingerprint on the Wearable Device</h1> <div><ol><li><span>Open <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides-V5/ide-signing-V5\" target=\"_blank\">the .cer file</a>, and copy information in the <strong>last paragraph</strong> (from <strong>BEGIN CERTIFICATE</strong> to <strong>END CERTIFICATE</strong>) to the new text to create a .cer file.</span><p></p><div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>Figure 1 </b>Creating a cer file (for reference only)</span><br><span><img height=\"302.089151\" originheight=\"475\" originwidth=\"819\" src=\"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20251013105408.67993617259056552809210480978174:50001231000000:2800:F5C13EA692A1F8E7C22E9865D9C7E7DD6C4287796A7FD81D5A26F38D5A086C01.png\" title=\"Click to enlarge\" width=\"523.6875\"></span></div> <p></p></li><li><span>Windows: Open the .cer file, and click <strong>Details</strong> and then <strong>Public key</strong> to obtain the pubKey.</span><p></p><div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>Figure 2 </b>Windows: obtaining the pubKey (for reference only)</span><br><span><img height=\"561.146817\" originheight=\"602\" originwidth=\"469\" src=\"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20251013105408.58984510747131382692728812639906:50001231000000:2800:805463C2CC0C400FA2DDD404FEFB2162F1B223133E4F72DA6652C1CA7D1D1ACA.png\" title=\"Click to enlarge\" width=\"399\"></span></div> <p>macOS: Run <strong>openssl x509 -in test.cer -text -noout</strong> in the CLI. Replace <strong>test.cer</strong> with the name of the new .cer file.</p> <div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>Figure 3 </b>macOS: obtaining the pubKey (for reference only)</span><br><span><img height=\"292.26750000000004\" originheight=\"562\" originwidth=\"1004\" src=\"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20251013105408.42078030582445337758430245822614:50001231000000:2800:EA70FADFD739E738548E754DAA922214E3EDAF898355C1759CD05FAC2A77BA89.png\" title=\"Click to enlarge\" width=\"523.6875\"></span></div> <p></p></li><li><span>Encode the pubKey to Base64 format. Visit a third-party website (such as <a href=\"https://www.tomeko.net/online_tools/hex_to_base64.php?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\">tomeko.net</a>) for transferring code, for example, BC5Z9/29Yn93xSa9XkQ2HN5GikugmXjor9se0VwnOENK9t4uFK4VlRpOHv4B3lphjIa7P6Sh61CFRsT0MZNhuV8=.</span></li><li><span>Fingerprint information = App package name _base64Encode(pubKey), for example, com.huawei.wearengine_BC5Z9/29Yn93xSa9XkQ2HN5GikugmXjor9se0VwnOENK9t4uFK4VlRpOHv4B3lphjIa7P6Sh61CFRsT0MZNhuV8=.</span><p></p><div class=\"note\"><img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"106\" src=\"https://alliance-communityfile-drcn.dbankcdn.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20251013105408.43189222914266243876259136830256:50001231000000:2800:98106DDE48BA4ADCC783D90AC95492377D492CAF68DB7E2EAE468CEE27202B33.png\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span><div class=\"notebody\"><p>The maximum length of the fingerprint on the lite wearable device is 127 bits.</p> </div></div> <p></p></li></ol> </div> <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"signature-0000001053969657","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2025-10-13 02:54:08","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Devices","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":true,"versionLabels":[],"contentLabels":[],"showBeta":0}}